h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Consumable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">8.00<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">June 26, 2007<br/>Summer Update 2007</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20070621174715&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Bullseye_Potion_64f82d.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a bullseye potion.<div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 2.00 oz.</div><div class=\"p-flavortext\">Drinking this potion temporarily increases your distance skill while decreasing your defense.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"><span class=\"tibiatext tibiaorange\"><ul class=\"sound-list\"></ul></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>Drinking this potion increases distance skill by 5 points while decreasing shielding by 10 points for 10 minutes. You can only have one distance boosting skill active at a time, i.e. you cannot use this and Sharpshooter, <a href=\"#/wiki/Carrot%20Cake\">Carrot Cake</a>, or <a href=\"#/wiki/Lemon%20Cupcake\">Lemon Cupcake</a> at the same time.\n</p><p>Obtainable in the <a href=\"#/quest/barbarian-arena-quest\">Barbarian Arena Quest</a>, Formorgar Mine Quest, <a href=\"#/quest/frost-dragon-quest\">Frost Dragon Quest</a>, <a href=\"#/quest/the-new-frontier-quest\">The New Frontier Quest</a>, and the <a href=\"#/quest/rise-of-devovorga\">Rise of Devovorga</a>. Can also be obtained from <a href=\"#/wiki/Gnomish%20Supply%20Package\">Gnomish Supply Packages</a>.\n</p><p>Drinking 100 of these grants the Sharpshooter achievement.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Alptramun\">Alptramun</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Bakragore\">Bakragore</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Brain%20Head\">Brain Head</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Chagorz\">Chagorz</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Count%20Vlarkorth\">Count Vlarkorth</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Crazed%20Summer%20Vanguard\">Crazed Summer Vanguard</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Drume\">Drume</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Duke%20Krule\">Duke Krule</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Earl%20Osam\">Earl Osam</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Elder%20Forest%20Fury\">Elder Forest Fury</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Ghulosh\">Ghulosh</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Gorzindel\">Gorzindel</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Goshnar%27s%20Cruelty\">Goshnar's Cruelty</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Goshnar%27s%20Greed\">Goshnar's Greed</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Goshnar%27s%20Hatred\">Goshnar's Hatred</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Goshnar%27s%20Malice\">Goshnar's Malice</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Goshnar%27s%20Megalomania\">Goshnar's Megalomania</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Goshnar%27s%20Spite\">Goshnar's Spite</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Haunted%20Treeling\">Haunted Treeling</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Ichgahal\">Ichgahal</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Izcandar%20Champion%20of%20Summer\">Izcandar Champion of Summer</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Izcandar%20Champion%20of%20Winter\">Izcandar Champion of Winter</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Izcandar%20the%20Banished\">Izcandar the Banished</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/